  "id": "ss.terrain.tree-snag",
  "name": "Cave snag (SS)",
  "description": "A tree the cave is done with: the trunk snapped off head-height, split into two points, rotted through in bands and holed where something lives in it now. Dead grey against the other two's dusk, and the one tree in the set with no crown at all \u2014 it stops you and it hides nothing, which is what gives a grove a shape that is not all the same shape. A span can still be tied to it.",
